WEBVTT

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.960
Alfredo Sotto Corpuz: Senate President, the Presiding Officer of the Impeachment Court, and the Senator-Judges.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.250
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Sergeant-at-Arms is directed to make a proclamation.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:39.750
Alfredo Sotto Corpuz: All persons are commanded to keep silent under pain of penalty while the Impeachment Court is in session for the trial of Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:52.220
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: The impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte is hereby called to order. We shall be led in prayer by Senator Pia Cayetano.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:06:01.370
Sen. Pia S. Cayetano: Let us bow our heads. Heavenly Father, we come before you today with a deep sense of responsibility. We ask for your wisdom, Lord, the kind of wisdom that seeks only what is true and what is right. As Senator judges, may we listen carefully, reason clearly, and decide justly. May we never lose sight of the fact that our role here is not to serve any interest, but the interest of the Filipino people and the integrity of our institutions. We pray for fairness in every step of this process. May the truth be heard, may the evidence speak for itself, and may justice, whatever form it takes, be arrived at with honesty and with clear conscience. We also pray for our nation. We know that moments like this can divide us. May this process, difficult as it is, bring us closer to the kind of Philippines we all want to live in, one where no one is above the law and where every Filipino can trust that justice is real. In your word, Book of Timothy. 2, verses 1 to 2, Timothy urges the people to pray, petition, and intercede for their leaders. We are a prayerful nation, O Lord. Please hear our prayers. In Jesus' name, amen.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:02.410
Sen. Pia S. Cayetano: Amen.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.680
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: The Clerk of Court will now call the roll.

