Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Senator-Judge Anad Quetano's concern has no basis if it was all pre-marked, apparently. It was our oversight. Counsel for the prosecutors, would that be possible? Yes. To furnish it? I think what counsel for respondent did earlier helped us out a lot.

