John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Good afternoon, Your Honor.

02:20:09.450 --> 02:20:32.510
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Medyo mahaba na yung pag-upo mo dyan but allow me a few questions. Yung circumstance lang, so paano nagsimula yung investigasyon? Na na-involve ka. Were you from the start o hindi? At written instructions ba to? O sinabi, oh may investigation tayo? Just konting clarity, paano na umpisa yung specific investigation? And was it based on the November 3 video? Tama ba?

02:20:32.730 --> 02:20:46.010
