02:20:47.750 --> 02:20:53.750
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Which is classified as threat and I was tasked and assigned to investigate the case, sir.

02:20:53.870 --> 02:20:59.510
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Okay. So basically ganun yung pagkasabi na I'm asking you to look at the video, investigate.

02:20:59.970 --> 02:21:00.610
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, your honor.

02:21:00.790 --> 02:21:02.800
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Were you working alone or with a group?

02:21:02.800 --> 02:21:04.250
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: With a group, your honor.

02:21:04.250 --> 02:21:05.250
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: NBI group?

02:21:05.250 --> 02:21:06.220
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, your honor.

02:21:06.220 --> 02:21:10.770
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And was this, is there an interagency also or just purely NBI?

02:21:11.330 --> 02:21:18.110
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: I don't have personal knowledge. Maybe our chief, sir, has the knowledge on that, sir. That's all I asked for naman, yung personal

02:21:18.110 --> 02:21:18.510
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: knowledge.

02:21:18.690 --> 02:21:19.270
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: So,

02:21:19.330 --> 02:21:28.870
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: pakiulit mo yung sinabing, how exactly sinabi sa'yo na tignan mo yung video, imbistigaan mo, or may statement?

02:21:30.370 --> 02:21:35.410
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: To be specific, sir, as far as I remember, may

02:21:37.040 --> 02:21:49.590
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: statement si Vice President regarding the November 23 press conference na kung saan. May pagbabanta na naganap. Pakiimbestigahan.

02:21:50.190 --> 02:21:54.300
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Pakiimbestigahan. So ganun ka-general? May pagbabantang naganap, pakiimbestigahan?

02:21:54.300 --> 02:21:55.000
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes po.

02:21:55.000 --> 02:21:56.900
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And you proceeded by watching the video?

02:21:56.900 --> 02:21:57.750
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:21:57.750 --> 02:22:01.070
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And when you watched the video, you got to the part na may pagbabanta?

02:22:01.570 --> 02:22:06.590
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: No, Your Honor. I first don't know which part of that.

02:22:06.590 --> 02:22:08.330
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: So you watched the whole video, of course?

02:22:08.330 --> 02:22:13.270
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: First the clippings, Your Honor. Then I looked for the whole video, Your Honor.

02:22:13.620 --> 02:22:14.670
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Then you watched the whole video?

02:22:14.670 --> 02:22:15.320
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:22:15.320 --> 02:22:25.440
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And thank you for your honesty. So after the clipping, tapos the whole video, what did you do next? You reported or you made your recommendations? I don't understand the process lang kasi.

02:22:26.640 --> 02:22:32.260
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Upon identifying the whole video, I informed my executive officer that I identified the video, Your Honor.

02:22:32.900 --> 02:22:40.280
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And then yung sinabi mo yesterday, then you started looking for patterns. That's why you looked at yung dating mga video ni Vice President.

02:22:40.650 --> 02:22:41.090
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:22:41.270 --> 02:22:47.850
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: So you started investigating the threat against the President, the First Lady, and the former Speaker of the House.

02:22:48.050 --> 02:22:48.450
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:22:48.610 --> 02:22:53.570
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Did you investigate the threat against the Vice President? We tried, Your Honor. How did you try?

02:22:54.090 --> 02:22:57.430
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: It is included in our letter to the Vice President, Your Honor.

02:22:58.950 --> 02:23:04.470
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: That's why we're inviting her to proceed to our office to investigate the threats to her life, Your Honor.

02:23:04.970 --> 02:23:12.900
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: How about the vlogger who asked her about Oplan or whatever they call that Romanov, did you invite them?

02:23:12.900 --> 02:23:13.650
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:23:13.650 --> 02:23:15.010
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And did they testify?

02:23:15.670 --> 02:23:18.610
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: The Princess Maui did not appear, Your Honor. Did not

02:23:18.610 --> 02:23:19.470
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: appear. Did

02:23:19.470 --> 02:23:20.070
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: you also look

02:23:20.070 --> 02:23:25.330
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: for previous videos that are threatening to the Vice President?

02:23:27.980 --> 02:23:37.540
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: We looked on the Romanov part, Your Honor. But we identified a different person who first mentioned the Romanov, Your Honor.

02:23:37.540 --> 02:23:39.850
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Did you coordinate with the PSG?

02:23:39.850 --> 02:23:42.150
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: I have no personal knowledge, your honor.

02:23:42.150 --> 02:23:43.030
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: You yourself?

02:23:43.410 --> 02:23:44.880
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, your honor. Maybe our chief, your honor.

02:23:44.880 --> 02:23:51.330
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: But you are aware that the primary responsibility of protecting both the president and the vice president is the PSG?

02:23:51.570 --> 02:23:52.110
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, your honor.

02:23:52.290 --> 02:24:04.850
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: So isn't it fair to say that any investigation against a threat to the first family, the president or the vice president, you would normally ask the PSG if they received any threat?

02:24:06.990 --> 02:24:08.850
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: I have no personal knowledge, Your Honor.

02:24:08.850 --> 02:24:19.700
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: I'm asking, hindi ba normal sa investigation kung sino yung primary agency na taga-protekta na lumalaban dun sa threat ay tatanungin natin?

02:24:19.700 --> 02:24:21.060
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:24:21.060 --> 02:24:26.460
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: So bakit hindi tinanong ng NBI ang PSG? Or in your case, why didn't you ask the PSG?

02:24:30.020 --> 02:24:32.700
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Maybe it can be answered by ICHIP, Your Honor.

02:24:33.000 --> 02:25:05.450
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: No, I'm not... I will ask your chief also I'm asking you when they said look at this you looked at other videos you tried to get Princess Maui you tried to get the vice president but you didn't contact the PSG for the first lady for the president and for you know for for all you know the PSG will tell you right there and there the threat is real or the PSG will say politika lang yan diba both The Vice President and the President are protected by the PSG. So why wasn't... So nakalimutan lang or wala sa procedure niyo or...

02:25:05.450 --> 02:25:13.230
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Your Honor, there's already a statement from the National Security Council, Your Honor, that it is an active threat, Your Honor. That's why we start investigation.

02:25:13.730 --> 02:26:15.650
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Yes, and the primary group that will know if it's an active threat is the PSG. So if this was the United States, it will be the Secret Service. So, whether the FBI or the CIA, state troopers, the federal marshals, kung sino man mag-iimbestiga, parati nilang tatanungin yung Secret Service. So, I'm just curious why we did not ask the PSG input. Kindly wind up, Sen. Gaetano. Sen. Judge Gaetano. So, my last question is, how did you characterize the threat of the Vice President to the President? Given that ang exact words niya, wag kang mag-alamam sa security ko kasi may kinausap na ang tao, sinabi ko sa kanya, kapag pinatay ako. So, I'll be fair to you and not vague, no? Did that phrase, kapag pinatay ako, have any bearing in your investigation?

02:26:16.250 --> 02:26:16.910
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:26:17.230 --> 02:26:19.850
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: And what was that bearing or thoughts in your mind?

02:26:20.350 --> 02:26:29.820
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: First of all po, dun sa statement, may nakausap na po. It already took place before pa yung mangyari yung meeting. Excuse me,

02:26:29.820 --> 02:26:36.080
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: I'm not talking about yung may kinausap na para pumatay. Ang sinasabi ko, yung sinabi niya na pag pinatay ako.

02:26:36.300 --> 02:26:37.080
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Yes, Your Honor.

02:26:37.100 --> 02:26:38.980
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: How did that affect your

02:26:38.980 --> 02:26:39.970
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: investigation?

02:26:39.970 --> 02:27:10.110
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: There is a condition na kapag pinatay siya. But as we can see, it's only applicable if there is only two parties. The statement make a loophole wherein a third party can use that Kapag namatay si BP, ma-execute ngayon yung statement ni BP na may nakausap na siya without the participation of the one mentioned, the President, the First Lady, and the Speaker of the House, Your Honor.

02:27:10.710 --> 02:27:56.900
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: That's fair. But what I'm saying is that in your reports, did you characterize it as a conditional threat? Kasi kung hindi naman siya pinatay, The logical implication is that there's no threat against the— So I'm not saying it's not illegal, immoral to contract a killer. I'm just trying to follow the logic na pag— So pag sinabi kong pakukulong kita, Mr. Witness, pag nagsinungaling ka under oath, then it's actually not a threat, it's a legal— I'm just telling you the law, di ba? Pero pag sinabi kong pag hindi ka sumunod sa akin, anuin kita. That's my last question lang. So how did you characterize that? It wasn't a conditional in your mind? Because may kinausap na?

02:27:58.140 --> 02:28:02.740
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Even with or without, sir, it's still considered a threat as long as the person— I

02:28:02.740 --> 02:28:03.160
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: have no

02:28:03.160 --> 02:28:05.700
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: doubt there. I'm just asking, is it a conditional threat?

02:28:11.190 --> 02:28:14.850
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Based on our affidavit, sir, I believe it's conditional.

02:28:16.690 --> 02:28:17.170
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Based

02:28:17.170 --> 02:28:18.250
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: on your affidavit? Affidavit.

02:28:18.510 --> 02:28:18.950
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: But your

02:28:18.950 --> 02:28:25.220
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: initial assessment, personal mo as an investigator, this is an investigation of the whole NBI, but yung personal mo?

02:28:25.220 --> 02:28:27.040
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: The threat is absolute, sir.

02:28:27.040 --> 02:28:29.250
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Okay. Thank you, Mr. President. Thank you.

