02:31:33.400 --> 02:31:35.480
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Maraming salamat po.

02:31:36.650 --> 02:31:42.750
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Padilla. Senator Judge Zubiri, you are recognized, sir. You have two minutes.

02:31:43.210 --> 02:32:14.360
Sen. Juan Miguel “Migz” Zubiri: Maraming salamat to our presiding officer. Magandang hapon po, Sir Witness. Good afternoon, Your Honor. Gusto ko lang magtanong, clarificatory questions lang po ito. Dito ba sa ating bansa, dahil tinatanong ko po sa inyo dahil kayo po investigating body, sa ating bansa, meron bang specific law? Pagdating sa mga banta sa pangulo, pangalawang pangulo, at kanyang mga successors, or yan ba'y pasok lang sa grave threats, which is applied sa lahat, applicable sa lahat ng tao?

02:32:14.600 --> 02:32:18.360
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: Based on my personal knowledge, sir, it's only on the grave threat, Your Honor.

02:32:18.620 --> 02:32:56.070
Sen. Juan Miguel “Migz” Zubiri: Which is applied to everyone, if I'm not mistaken, no? Kasi sa batas sa Amerika, sa Estados Unidos, meron pong tinatawag na No. 18 under the United States Code Section 871, there is a specific law na pinagbabawal po itong mga threats to the Vice President and its successors. May jail time po ito at may fine na malaki. As a matter of fact, dito sa panahon ni Pangulong Trump, marami na po silang kinasuhan at hinabla

02:33:13.440 --> 02:33:28.900
John Mark Sta. Ana Calilung: [unclear] under our law, after the new NBI law, included po investigation into threats to the life of the President, the Vice President, the Speaker, the Senate President, and the Supreme Court, sir.

02:33:29.100 --> 02:33:52.950
Sen. Juan Miguel “Migz” Zubiri: So, ah, klaro na kayo, nasa kapangyarihan ninyo. Kasi hindi pwede sa Presidential Security Group. Hindi ka tulad sa Estados Unidos, yung Secret Service ang talagang nanguhuli at nag-investiga. Sa atin dito sa Pilipinas, ang NBI po ang nangunguna sa investigasyon. Tama pong gawin yan o mali? It is within our law,

02:33:53.010 --> 02:33:53.130
